# The validation environment's own inputs to scripts/gcp/deploy.sh (dev.env says how these files
# are read). Empty, as prod's: validation is qualified with production's configuration, and
# its alerts, like prod's, must page a real recipient. No EXPECTED_PROJECT_ID yet, so deploy.sh
# refuses to deploy validation anywhere until its project is named here.
#
# NAME=value lines only (test/ci/environment-inputs.test.ts).
